msgstr "Waiting for review results and release of rankings"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:804
msgid "申請截止後由海聯會及各校審查。通常於每年 5～6 月公告錄取結果。請密切注意海聯會官網及承辦窗口通知。"
msgstr ""
"Applications will be reviewed by the AIS and each school after the deadline."
" Admission results are usually announced from May to June every year. Please"
" pay close attention to the official website of the Overseas Alliance and "
"the notification from the hosting window."

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:805
msgid "每年 5 月～6 月"
msgstr "May to June every year"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:811
msgid "確認志願並辦理赴台簽證"
msgstr "Confirm your intention and apply for a visa to Taiwan"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:812
msgid "收到錄取通知後，依指定期限確認接受錄取。向台灣駐外機構（如台北經濟文化辦事處）申請學生居留簽證（Resident Visa）。"
msgstr ""
"After receiving the admission notice, confirm acceptance according to the "
"specified deadline. Apply for a student residence visa (Resident Visa) from "
"Taiwan’s overseas missions (such as the Taipei Economic and Cultural "
"Office)."

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:813
msgid "每年 6 月～7 月"
msgstr "June to July every year"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:814
msgid "辦理學生居留簽"
msgstr "Apply for student residence visa"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:820
msgid "抵台入學報到"
msgstr "Arrive in Taiwan and register for admission"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:821
msgid "抵台後按學校通知時程辦理入學報到，並在 15 天內至移民署辦理外僑居留證（ARC）。同時參加學校國際事務處的新生說明會。"
msgstr ""
"After arriving in Taiwan, you must register for admission according to the "
"schedule notified by the school, and go to the Immigration Department to "
"apply for an Alien Residence Certificate (ARC) within 15 days. At the same "
"time, attend the orientation meeting for new students held by the "
"International Affairs Office of the school."

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:822
msgid "每年 8 月底～9 月初"
msgstr "Every year from the end of August to the beginning of September"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:823
msgid "完成入學！"
msgstr "Enrollment completed!"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:829
msgid "常見問題"
msgstr "FAQ"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:833
msgid "我是外籍生（非僑生），可以透過海聯會申請嗎？"
msgstr ""
"I am a foreign student (non-overseas Chinese), can I apply through the "
"Overseas Alliance?"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:838
msgid ""
"不可以。海聯會管道僅適用於具僑生身份的申請者。外籍生（持外國國籍但不符僑生認定）須直接向各大學的國際招生辦公室申請，各校招生時程與文件要求請見各校官網。"
msgstr ""
"Can't. The Overseas Alliance Channel is only applicable to applicants with "
"overseas Chinese status. Foreign students (holding foreign nationality but "
"not qualifying as overseas students) must apply directly to the "
"international admissions office of each university. For the admissions "
"schedule and document requirements of each school, please see the official "
"website of each school."

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:844
msgid "僑生與外籍生有什麼不同？"
msgstr ""
"What is the difference between overseas Chinese students and foreign "
"students?"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:849
msgid ""
"「僑生」是指具有中華民國國籍或華裔血統、長期居住海外並在當地接受教育者，依教育部規定認定，可享僑生獎學金及僑先部等特別管道。「外籍生」則是持非中華民國國籍護照入學者，通常透過各校獨立招生管道申請，可申請教育部臺灣獎學金。兩者身份認定不同，適用的招生管道與優惠也不同。"
msgstr ""
"\"Overseas Chinese students\" refer to those who have the nationality of the"
" Republic of China or Chinese ancestry, have lived overseas for a long time "
"and received education locally. They are recognized in accordance with the "
"regulations of the Ministry of Education and can enjoy special channels such"
" as the Overseas Chinese Student Scholarship and the Overseas Chinese "
"Priority Department. \"Foreign students\" are those who hold a non-Republic "
"of China nationality passport and usually apply through independent "
"admissions channels of each school. They can apply for the Ministry of "
"Education Taiwan Scholarship. The two identities are different, and the "
"applicable enrollment channels and discounts are also different."

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:855
msgid "可以同時申請多所學校嗎？"
msgstr "Can I apply to multiple schools at the same time?"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:860
msgid ""
"海聯會管道可填寫多個志願（學校 + "
"系所），系統依志願序分發，通常一個申請可含多個志願。外籍生透過各校獨立申請時，只要在截止期限前分別向各校提交申請即可，但需留意各校的申請費及文件要求可能不同。"
msgstr ""
"You can fill in multiple applications (school + department) in the Overseas "
"Alliance Pipeline, and the system distributes them in order of application. "
"Usually, one application can contain multiple applications. When foreign "
"students apply independently through each school, they only need to submit "
"their applications to each school before the deadline. However, please note "
"that the application fees and document requirements of each school may be "
"different."

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:866
msgid "中文不夠好，可以申請中文授課的系所嗎？"
msgstr ""
"If my Chinese is not good enough, can I apply for a department that teaches "
"in Chinese?"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:871
msgid ""
"各系所對中文能力要求不同。部分系所設有最低中文檢定門檻（如 TOCFL B1 "
"以上），部分則接受入學後修讀中文語言課程作為補強。建議查閱目標系所的最新招生簡章確認，或聯繫學校國際事務處詢問。若中文尚未達標，也可先考慮申請全英語授課的系所或語言先修課程。"
msgstr ""
"Each department has different requirements for Chinese proficiency. Some "
"departments have a minimum Chinese proficiency test threshold (such as TOCFL"
" B1 or above), and some accept Chinese language courses as supplement after "
"admission. It is recommended to check the latest admission brochure of the "
"target department to confirm, or contact the school's International Affairs "
"Office for enquiry. If your Chinese language skills are not up to standard, "
"you may also consider applying to departments or language preparatory "
"courses taught entirely in English."

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:877
msgid "申請獎學金需要另外申請嗎？"
msgstr "Do I need to apply separately to apply for a scholarship?"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:882
msgid ""
"教育部臺灣獎學金需在入學申請時或入學後另行提出申請，通常透過台灣駐外機構或直接向學校申請，名額有限，競爭較激烈。僑生獎學金部分由海聯會或學校自動審核，部分需額外填寫申請表。學校自設的入學獎助學金通常在錄取通知中會一併說明。"
msgstr ""
"The Ministry of Education's Taiwan Scholarship needs to be applied for at "
"the time of admission or separately after admission. You usually apply "
"through Taiwan's overseas institutions or directly to the school. The number"
" of places is limited and the competition is fierce. Some scholarships for "
"overseas Chinese students are automatically reviewed by the Overseas Chinese"
" Association or the school, while some require an additional application "
"form to be filled out. The school's own entrance scholarships and bursaries "
"are usually stated in the admission notice."

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:888
msgid "我已在台灣就讀，可以轉學嗎？"
msgstr "I am already studying in Taiwan, can I transfer?"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:893
msgid ""
"可以，但需注意轉學申請通常有年級限制（多限大二、大三），且需提供原校成績單及放棄學籍證明。各校轉學招生時程不一，通常在每學年結束前後辦理，詳情請查閱目標校系的轉學考簡章。研究所學生轉所需依各所規定辦理。"
msgstr ""
"Yes, but please note that transfer applications usually have grade "
"restrictions (mostly sophomores and juniors), and you need to provide "
"transcripts from the original school and proof of abandonment of student "
"status. The transfer admissions process varies from school to school and is "
"usually processed around the end of each school year. For details, please "
"refer to the transfer examination guide of the target school. Graduate "
"student transfer needs to be handled in accordance with the regulations of "
"each institute."

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:900
msgid "重要聯絡與資源"
msgstr "Important contacts and resources"

